without_editor_info theorem checks13 : ∀ i : Fin 55, jointEnvelopeFastCheck (envelopes13 i) pi rho 13 1160 1036 3 (values 2195 1543 i) (certificatesC13 i) (certificatesD13 i) := by decide +kernel

